Problem
Install tomcat server on App Server 3, configure it to run on port 8084, and deploy ROOT.war.

Solution
bash
# On Jump Host
scp /tmp/ROOT.war app-server-3-user@app-server-3-ip:/tmp

# On App Server 3
sudo yum install tomcat
sudo sed -i 's/8080/8084/' /etc/tomcat/server.xml
sudo cp /tmp/ROOT.war /var/lib/tomcat/webapps/
sudo systemctl restart tomcat

# Test
curl http://localhost:8084
